      "id": "claim_0020aa8765ae47aa893556809ab60e2e",
      "statement": "src/config/theme.ts is the canonical source of design-token hex values: it exports themeTokens, a pure constant record keyed by ThemeMode ('dark' | 'light', dark first/default) whose `as const satisfies Record<ThemeMode, ThemeTokens>` makes the compiler enforce identical key sets across modes; src/global.css mirrors every color as a --color-app-* Uniwind CSS variable inside @variant dark/@variant light blocks and defines the four font families under @theme, with a header comment pointing back to theme.ts and a keep-in-sync rule that a value change requires editing both files.",
      "evidence": [
