      "id": "claim_ea9d33c76bbc4c7288eb8b42e5c55de6",
      "statement": "In-app charts render SVG and therefore cannot use Uniwind classes: both LiquidityBarChart and PriceChart read useThemeTokens() and derive SVG strings — liquidity chart: active bin tokens.primary, below-active tokens.secondary, above tokens.border, grid border+alpha; price chart: up candles tokens.primary, down candles tokens.negative, range band primary at low/high alpha; the alpha convention appends 8-digit hex suffixes (1F≈0.12, 4D≈0.3, 80≈0.5) to the 6-digit token — while legend swatches stay as Uniwind classes so they track the theme automatically.",
