      "id": "claim_1b06d7ee3f27495ab194b002037ed6ce",
      "statement": "Three shared primitives are the single implementations of their patterns and must be imported, not duplicated: ChartPanel (chart eyebrow + current-price header directly on the card, no nested container), SegmentedControl (the only segmented toggle — chart-mode and SOL/USD both render through it — with a sliding primaryDim indicator pill tracked to measured geometry and a 130ms label crossfade honoring ReduceMotion.System), and ShimmerBlock (the only shimmer, a 2s repeating opacity loop 0.4→0.7; a duplicate in PositionCardSkeleton was removed). Skeletons keep the loaded card background (bg-app-surface), use bg-app-border placeholder blocks for contrast, leave static labels unshimmered, and match the real layout to avoid shift on load.",
