      "id": "claim_1be97203aa254ba78f5a82ba2e84dcc0",
      "statement": "Cross-cutting styling conventions enforced by DESIGN.md and AGENTS.md: never use raw Tailwind palette classes (emerald-*, red-*, zinc-*, …) — state colors map through the semantic app-* tokens; never hardcode hex in components — even native-prop/SVG surfaces take values from useThemeTokens(); never mix inline style and className for the same property (inline wins); and every interactive Pressable gets active:opacity-80 as its state layer, except press-to-dismiss scrims and stop-propagation containers.",
